---
import Ring from './Ring.astro';
---
<section id="promises" class="board" aria-labelledby="promises-title">
  <div class="tile tile--6x2 tile--head" data-reveal style="--i:0">
    <h2 id="promises-title" class="head">Why it sticks</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="tile tile--3x2 tile--green" data-reveal style="--i:1">
    <div class="ui ui--flow ui--badge" data-ui>
      <span class="seal" aria-hidden="true"></span> Matched · USDA<span class="only-wide"> · Fage</span>
    </div>
    <div class="tile__cap"><strong>Numbers you can trust</strong><span>You pick every USDA match or scan the label. An estimate is shown as one.</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="tile tile--3x2 tile--surface" data-reveal style="--i:2">
    <div class="ui ui--flow ui--modes" data-ui>
      <span class="mode mode--plan">Planning</span>
      <span class="mode mode--log">Logging</span>
    </div>
    <div class="tile__cap"><strong>Your plan is never overwritten</strong><span>Planning and logging look nothing alike, so you always know which one you're in.</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="tile tile--6x4 tile--indigo" data-reveal style="--i:3">
    <div class="ui ui--ring" data-ui>
      <Ring class="ring--reveal" size="100%" width={0.1} eaten={0.21} lands={0.985} zoneStart={0.976} zoneEnd={1.024} />
      <div class="ui__center nums"><strong>44</strong><span>/210</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="tile__cap"><strong>Close counts</strong><span>Every target has its own ± range. Land anywhere inside it and the day is a win.</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="tile tile--3x4 tile--surface2" data-reveal style="--i:4">
    <div class="ui ui--stepper nums" data-ui>
      <span class="stp__btn">−</span><span class="stp__val">250</span><span class="stp__unit">g</span><span class="stp__btn">+</span>
    </div>
    <div class="tile__cap"><strong>No serving sizes to guess</strong><span>Portions are weights on a 5 g grid, shown in ounces, cups or tablespoons if you prefer.</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="tile tile--3x4 tile--deepgreen" data-reveal style="--i:5">
    <div class="ui ui--floats nums" data-ui>
      <strong>21</strong><span class="of">/104</span>
      <span class="lbl">Fat</span>
      <span class="state">floats · in range</span>
    </div>
    <div class="tile__cap"><strong>One number gets to give</strong><span>Let a macro float: it is balanced last and never marks your day off.</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="tile tile--6x2 tile--amber" data-reveal style="--i:6">
    <div class="ui ui--flow ui--off nums" data-ui>
      <span class="off__title">Diverged from plan</span>
      <span class="off__vals">+2 P · +11 C · +2 F</span>
    </div>
    <div class="tile__cap"><strong>Off plan isn't failure</strong><span>Eat something unplanned and the day says so, then re-sizes what's left to land it.</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="tile tile--3x2 tile--surface" data-reveal style="--i:7">
    <div class="ui ui--flow ui--logbtn nums" data-ui>
      <span class="chk" aria-hidden="true"></span> Log meal · 761 kcal
    </div>
    <div class="tile__cap"><strong>Logging is one tap</strong><span>Ate what you planned? Tap Log meal. Nothing counts until you do.</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="tile tile--3x2 tile--surface2" data-reveal style="--i:8">
    <div class="ui ui--flow ui--sync" data-ui>
      <span class="row"><span>iCloud sync</span><span class="on">On</span></span>
      <span class="row"><span>Account</span><span class="muted">None</span></span>
    </div>
    <div class="tile__cap"><strong>No account, no tracking</strong><span>Your data lives on your phone and in your iCloud. Claude and USDA are reached directly, never through a server of ours.</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .board { margin-top: var(--section); padding: 0 10px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr)); grid-auto-rows: minmax(104px, auto); gap: 8px; }
  .tile { position: relative; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 0; background: var(--surface); padding: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-end; }
  .tile--6x2 { grid-column: span 6; grid-row: span 2; }
  .tile--6x4 { grid-column: span 6; grid-row: span 4; }
  .tile--3x4 { grid-column: span 3; grid-row: span 4; }
  .tile--3x2 { grid-column: span 3; grid-row: span 2; }
  .tile--head { background: var(--bg); justify-content: flex-start; padding: 20px 20px 0; }
  .tile--head h2 { font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4vw, 3.75rem); max-width: 12ch; }
  .tile--green { background: var(--green); color: var(--accent-ink); }
  .tile--deepgreen { background: var(--green-deep); }
  .tile--indigo { background: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-ink); }
  .tile--amber { background: var(--amber); color: var(--accent-ink); }
  .tile--surface2 { background: var(--surface-2); }
  .tile__cap { position: relative; z-index: 1; display: grid; gap: 0.15rem; max-width: 30ch; padding-top: 0.6rem; }
  .tile__cap strong { font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .tile__cap span { font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.4; opacity: 0.85; }

  /* Interface close-ups. The big ones (ring, stepper, floating figure) are pushed off-centre so their
     tall tile crops them. The small ones sit in the tile's flow above the caption, so a caption that
     wraps to another line makes the tile taller instead of sliding under the fragment. */
  .ui { position: absolute; pointer-events: none; }
  [data-ui].ui--flow { position: relative; margin-bottom: auto; max-width: 100%; align-self: flex-start; }
  [data-ui].ui--badge { font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.55vw, 1.6rem); font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4em; color: var(--accent-ink); }
  [data-ui] .seal { width: 1em; height: 1em; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent-ink); position: relative; flex: none; }
  [data-ui] .seal::after { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0.3em; top: 0.17em; width: 0.26em; height: 0.46em; border: solid var(--green); border-width: 0 0.12em 0.12em 0; transform: rotate(45deg); }
  [data-ui].ui--modes { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.45em; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  [data-ui] .mode { padding: 0.5em 1em; border-radius: 1.2em; }
  [data-ui] .mode--plan { color: var(--accent); border: 3px dashed var(--accent); }
  [data-ui] .mode--log { color: var(--green); border: 3px solid var(--green); background: rgba(61, 220, 132, 0.12); }
  [data-ui].ui--ring { top: -10%; right: -10%; width: 72%; aspect-ratio: 1; color: var(--accent-ink); }
  [data-ui].ui--ring :global(.ring__track) { stroke-opacity: 0.18; }
  [data-ui].ui--ring :global(.ring__plan) { stroke: var(--accent-ink); stroke-opacity: 0.5; }
  [data-ui].ui--ring :global(.ring__dot circle:first-child) { fill: var(--accent); }
  [data-ui] .ui__center { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: grid; place-content: center; text-align: center; }
  [data-ui] .ui__center strong { font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem); line-height: 1; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
  [data-ui] .ui__center span { font-size: 1.6rem; opacity: 0.7; }
  [data-ui] .ui__under { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 88%; text-align: center; font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 600; }
  [data-ui] .ui__under em { display: block; font-style: normal; color: var(--green-deep); }
  [data-ui].ui--stepper { top: 10%; left: 10%; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5em; font-size: 2.6rem; font-weight: 600; background: var(--bg); padding: 0.4em 0.6em; border-radius: 0.7em; white-space: nowrap; }
  [data-ui] .stp__btn { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 500; }
  [data-ui] .stp__val { color: var(--accent); }
  [data-ui] .stp__unit { font-size: 0.5em; color: var(--muted); }
  [data-ui].ui--floats { top: 8%; left: 10%; display: grid; line-height: 1; }
  [data-ui].ui--floats strong { font-size: 5rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
  [data-ui].ui--floats .of { font-size: 1.6rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 0.2em; }
  [data-ui].ui--floats .lbl { margin-top: 0.8rem; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; }
  [data-ui].ui--floats .state { color: var(--green); font-size: 1.4rem; margin-top: 0.3em; white-space: nowrap; }
  [data-ui].ui--off { display: grid; gap: 0.3em; font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; color: var(--accent-ink); }
  [data-ui] .off__vals { font-weight: 500; opacity: 0.8; }
  [data-ui].ui--logbtn { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5em; font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.6vw, 1.5rem); font-weight: 600; background: var(--green); color: var(--accent-ink); padding: 0.6em 1em; border-radius: 2em; white-space: nowrap; }
  [data-ui] .chk { width: 1em; height: 1em; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent-ink); position: relative; flex: none; }
  [data-ui] .chk::after { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0.33em; top: 0.18em; width: 0.24em; height: 0.44em; border: solid var(--green); border-width: 0 0.12em 0.12em 0; transform: rotate(45deg); }
  [data-ui].ui--sync { align-self: stretch; display: grid; gap: 0.3em; font-size: 1.1rem; }
  [data-ui] .row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2em; padding: 0.45em 0.8em; background: var(--bg); border-radius: 0.6em; }
  [data-ui] .on { color: var(--green); font-weight: 600; }

  @media (max-width: 64em) {
    .board { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); grid-auto-rows: minmax(30vw, auto); gap: 6px; padding: 0 6px; }
    .tile { padding: 16px; }
    .tile--6x2, .tile--head { grid-column: span 2; grid-row: span 2; }
    .tile--6x4 { grid-column: span 2; grid-row: span 3; }
    [data-ui].ui--ring { width: 60%; right: -8%; top: -6%; }
    .tile--3x4, .tile--3x2 { grid-column: span 1; grid-row: span 2; }
    .tile--head h2 { font-size: 9vw; }
    .tile__cap strong { font-size: 1rem; } .tile__cap span { font-size: 0.875rem; }
    [data-ui].ui--badge { font-size: 1.05rem; }
    [data-ui].ui--modes { font-size: 0.75rem; gap: 0.35em; }
    [data-ui].ui--stepper { font-size: 1.4rem; left: 6%; }
    [data-ui].ui--floats strong { font-size: 2.6rem; }
    [data-ui].ui--floats .lbl, [data-ui].ui--floats .state, [data-ui].ui--floats .of { display: none; }
    [data-ui].ui--floats .lbl, [data-ui].ui--floats .of { font-size: 1rem; } [data-ui].ui--floats .state { font-size: 0.9rem; } [data-ui].ui--floats .lbl { margin-top: 0.4rem; }
    [data-ui].ui--off { font-size: 1.4rem; }
    [data-ui].ui--logbtn { font-size: 0.85rem; }
    [data-ui].ui--sync { font-size: 0.9rem; }
    [data-ui].ui--sync .row { gap: 0.8em; }
  }
</style>
